          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"krishnakant"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450 Apex is an incredible scooter with amazing performance and accurate range delivery. It's efficient and fun to ride, though it could be more affordable.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"bhagat"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I'm proud to own the Ather Apex. It's an amazing vehicle with fantastic performance and a gadget-like feel. Servicing has been excellent, but charging points are scarce.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"rajni"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Apex is a great option for city rides, offering brisk acceleration and a smooth ride. However, the lack of charging infrastructure is a challenge.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"poonam"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've enjoyed riding the Apex for its speed and agility. However, the service experience could be improved with more centers.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"arman"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Apex is a solid choice for performance enthusiasts, but it lacks in terms of practicality for taller riders and those seeking more storage.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"ravi dubey"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450 Apex offers a fantastic riding experience with its Warp+ mode and excellent grip. However, the price is steep for some buyers.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","au